subproblem.statement:
For all m, j ∈ ℕ and every j-covector γ on ℝ^m (γ : Covector (Eucl m) j, a continuous alternating j-linear map (ℝ^m)^j → ℝ):
Σ_{i : Fin j → Fin m} γ(e_{i(1)}, …, e_{i(j)})² = j!·|γ|².
Here:
- e_1, …, e_m is the standard basis of ℝ^m (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin m) ℝ);
- |γ| = covectorEuclideanNorm γ = √(Σ_{I : Fin j → Fin m strictly increasing} γ(e_{I(1)}, …, e_{I(j)})²);
- the left-hand sum runs over all index tuples, not only injective or increasing ones.
